WEBVTT

00:06:56.473 --> 00:07:00.374
listening to a volunteer talk about how
she was getting a lot of calls

00:07:00.374 --> 00:07:03.069
from Christian women who 
were talking about God.

00:07:04.114 --> 00:07:08.038
Now, some of our volunteers are religious,
but this particular one was not.

00:07:08.247 --> 00:07:12.138
At first, it felt a little weird for her 
to talk to callers about God.

00:07:12.852 --> 00:07:15.282
So, she decided to get comfortable.

00:07:15.282 --> 00:07:19.137
And she stood in front of her mirror 
at home, and she said the word "God."

00:07:19.671 --> 00:07:20.375
"God."

00:07:20.785 --> 00:07:21.505
"God."

00:07:21.505 --> 00:07:22.225
"God."

00:07:22.225 --> 00:07:22.945
"God."

00:07:23.325 --> 00:07:24.027
"God."

00:07:24.282 --> 00:07:24.982
"God."

00:07:25.801 --> 00:07:29.081
Over and over and over again
until the word no longer felt strange

00:07:29.081 --> 00:07:31.211
coming out her mouth.